{"id":"come_die","lemma":"comédie","pos":"noun","rank":2115,"glosses":["comedy","comedy (genre of theatre, film, television etc.)","acting, playacting"],"ipa":"/kɔ.me.di/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/Fr-com%C3%A9die.ogg/Fr-com%C3%A9die.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"comédies"},"formAudio":{"comédies":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-com%C3%A9dies.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une comédie.","en":"It's a comedy movie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334724","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"J'adore les comédies.","en":"I love comedies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44231","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love, to adore","l":"adorer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"La comédie est quelque chose qui fait rire.","en":"Comedy is something that makes you laugh.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to laugh"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"something"]]},{"text":"En fait, c'est une comédie.","en":"Actually, it's a comedy.","words":[null,null,{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"actually"]]},{"text":"Les enfants agitent les brosses à dents comme s'ils se les brossaient, mais ils ne peuvent pas me jouer la comédie.","en":"The children are moving their toothbrushes as if they are cleaning their teeth, but they can't fool me.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"},{"g":"to shake, to wave","l":"agiter"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"brush","l":"brosse"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"tooth","l":"dent"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}